  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"1190\">\n<p data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"1050\"><strong data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"966\">Positive nuclear staining</strong>:<br data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"970\">Confirms <strong data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1007\">B-cell differentiation</strong> &ndash; seen in <strong data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1038\">B-cell lymphomas</strong>, including:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1190\">\n<li data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1092\">\n<p data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1092\">Diffuse large B-cell lymphoma (DLBCL)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1135\">\n<p data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1135\">B-ALL (B-acute lymphoblastic leukemia)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1187\">\n<p data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1187\">Classical Hodgkin lymphoma (partial expression)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1311\">\n<p data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1311\"><strong data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1205\">Negative</strong>:<br data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1209\">Helps rule out B-cell origin; can support diagnosis of <strong data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1285\">T-cell lymphoma</strong> or <strong data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1310\">myeloid neoplasms</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
